    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"InstanceComparator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util.comparator\"><code>InstanceComparator</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"InstanceComparator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util.comparator\"><code>InstanceComparator</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Only the specified <code>instanceOrder</code> classes are considered during comparison.\nIf two objects are both instances of the ordered type this comparator will return a\nvalue of <code>0</code>. Consider combining with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#thenComparing(java.util.Comparator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator.thenComparing(Comparator)</code></a>\nif additional sorting is required.",
      "translation": "仅考虑指定的 <code>instanceOrder</code> 类进行比较。如果两个对象都是有序类型的实例，则该比较器将返回 <code>0</code>。如果需要额外的排序，请考虑与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#thenComparing(java.util.Comparator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator.thenComparing(Comparator)</code></a> 结合使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#compare(T,T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">compare</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in InstanceComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#compare(T,T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">compare</a>` 接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in InstanceComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>` 中的方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>instanceOrder</code> - the ordered list of classes that should be used when comparing\nobjects. Classes earlier in the list will be given a higher priority.",
      "translation": "<code>instanceOrder</code> - 用于比较对象时应使用的类有序列表。列表中较早的类将获得更高的优先级。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of objects that may be compared by this comparator</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 此比较器可比较的对象类型</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
